<title>USA: G7, Russia, to meet May 15-17 next year in Britain.</title>
<headline>G7, Russia, to meet May 15-17 next year in Britain.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Group of Seven richest industrial nations and Russia agreed on Sunday to hold their annual summit next year in Birmingham, England, from May 15 to 17.</p>
<p>&quot;We have accepted the invitation of the prime minister of the United Kingdom (Tony Blair) to meet in Birmingham on 15-17 May next year,&quot; their final communique said.</p>
</text>
